  "translation": "Uye akasvika ⟨את⟩ zviyo zvomukati mehove dzomukati zvemudumbu nematambudziko — uye akaanza zvikuru zvemudumbu — aka dzoserwa matanga. Asi tarisa: akatema hove — hapana. Saka tsvagirai izvo zviri pachena: Uye ⟨את⟩ mukati mechirwere chakapiwa, uye ⟨את⟩ matanga, akasambisa mumvura; uye Moshe akapfava ⟨את⟩ hove yose pairari, chinhu chakakwana chekupfuura: chibairo chinopfuura, chinhu chinonhuwirira zvakanaka, chibairo chemoto chakaipa; sevakataura Yahwe kuna Moshe.",
